        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras/c3f289982254c63a94534f5277890b8e.avif?t=1766587015\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras_big/c3f289982254c63a94534f5277890b8e.avif?t=1766587015 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Story Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Sakura Miko and her fellow Hololive members were transported into <strong>an alternate future timeline</strong>.<br>In this unfamiliar world, they encounter mysterious figures, strange phenomena, and unexpected challenges.<br>To return home, Miko must reunite with her scattered friends and uncover the <strong>truth</strong> hidden within this warped reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>3D adventure game</strong> where the story unfolds through <strong>exploration, and puzzle-solving</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◎ Reunite and Grow Together</strong><br>Step into the role of Sakura Miko and set out to find the Hololive members lost across the strange new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras/81252f69985e8e729fab1b978d8b75c5.avif?t=1766587015\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◎ Exploration with the “Topic” System</strong><br>Scattered across the world are special “Topic Items” that open new conversations with the members.<br>Bring these items to the right person to trigger unique events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras/2f66803b2d37cb34eb315994da71d8b9.avif?t=1766587015\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras_big/2f66803b2d37cb34eb315994da71d8b9.avif?t=1766587015 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◎ Face Epic Bosses</strong><br>The road home is fraught with trials and challenges.<br>Take on powerful bosses and shape the outcome of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras/78652d998789a47f7def3710abe6ff41.avif?t=1766587015\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is part of the <strong>“holo Indie”</strong> brand (※2) and developed by <strong>CCMC Co., Ltd.</strong> (※1).<br>It is officially approved for distribution and monetization under the <i>holo Indie</i> guidelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that derivative games using COVER Corporation-owned content outside of <i>holo Indie</i> are <strong>not</strong> authorized for monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※1. <strong>About CCMC Co., Ltd.</strong><br>CCMC Co., Ltd. is officially commissioned by COVER Corporation to manage platforms (including Steam), conduct reviews, handle distribution, and oversee other necessary operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※2. <strong>About “holo Indie”</strong><br><i>holo Indie</i> is a game brand created to collaborate with fans and creators of Hololive Production.<br>It offers the <strong>Game Creator Support Program</strong> for derivative works.<br>For more information, please refer to COVER Corporation’s <i>Derivative Works Guidelines</i>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras/c3f289982254c63a94534f5277890b8e.avif?t=1766587015\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras_big/c3f289982254c63a94534f5277890b8e.avif?t=1766587015 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Story Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Sakura Miko and her fellow Hololive members were transported into <strong>an alternate future timeline</strong>.<br>In this unfamiliar world, they encounter mysterious figures, strange phenomena, and unexpected challenges.<br>To return home, Miko must reunite with her scattered friends and uncover the <strong>truth</strong> hidden within this warped reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>3D adventure game</strong> where the story unfolds through <strong>exploration, and puzzle-solving</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◎ Reunite and Grow Together</strong><br>Step into the role of Sakura Miko and set out to find the Hololive members lost across the strange new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras/81252f69985e8e729fab1b978d8b75c5.avif?t=1766587015\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◎ Exploration with the “Topic” System</strong><br>Scattered across the world are special “Topic Items” that open new conversations with the members.<br>Bring these items to the right person to trigger unique events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras/2f66803b2d37cb34eb315994da71d8b9.avif?t=1766587015\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras_big/2f66803b2d37cb34eb315994da71d8b9.avif?t=1766587015 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◎ Face Epic Bosses</strong><br>The road home is fraught with trials and challenges.<br>Take on powerful bosses and shape the outcome of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923980/extras/78652d998789a47f7def3710abe6ff41.avif?t=1766587015\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is part of the <strong>“holo Indie”</strong> brand (※2) and developed by <strong>CCMC Co., Ltd.</strong> (※1).<br>It is officially approved for distribution and monetization under the <i>holo Indie</i> guidelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that derivative games using COVER Corporation-owned content outside of <i>holo Indie</i> are <strong>not</strong> authorized for monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※1. <strong>About CCMC Co., Ltd.</strong><br>CCMC Co., Ltd. is officially commissioned by COVER Corporation to manage platforms (including Steam), conduct reviews, handle distribution, and oversee other necessary operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※2. <strong>About “holo Indie”</strong><br><i>holo Indie</i> is a game brand created to collaborate with fans and creators of Hololive Production.<br>It offers the <strong>Game Creator Support Program</strong> for derivative works.<br>For more information, please refer to COVER Corporation’s <i>Derivative Works Guidelines</i>.</p>",
